A plan inside a todo: the first of two todos is three jobs, and the user
asks for them to be planned under it when it is reached. The agent goes
two frames deep: each job is entered, done and closed, then the todo
above them, then the second todo. Every job must be done and recorded,
nothing left open, and the second todo must still be done after the
deeper frames close.

