Two todos for mem: (1) add input validation to the three Create functions in api.go, each with a test: CreateUser's name must not be empty, CreateOrder's qty must be from 1 to 100, CreateItem's sku must look like ABC-1234 (three capital letters, a hyphen, four digits). (1) is three jobs, so when you get to it, plan one todo per function under it. (2) Document the rules in README.md's API section. Do both.
